<title>USA: Giant Industries Inc Q1 net income falls.</title>
<headline>Giant Industries Inc Q1 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.10		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net			  1,124		    2,404</p>
<p> Revs		     116,138		  104,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,098		   11,251</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Co said decrease in earnings partially due to increase in depreciation attributable to acquisitions, new builds and remodels of service stations/convenience stores in the retail division and the amortization of turnaround costs in the refining division. Payroll and related costs also were higher.</p>
</text>
